# Changes to the rules, the code that enforces them, and the hub registry
# need a maintainer's review. Enable "Require review from Code Owners" in the
# branch protection rule for main to enforce this.
/.github/              @rest-of-us
/scripts/              @rest-of-us
/profiles/schema.json  @rest-of-us
/circles/schema.json   @rest-of-us
/hubs.json             @rest-of-us
/hubs.schema.json      @rest-of-us
/hub-template/         @rest-of-us
/js/                   @rest-of-us

# Profiles in the hubs hosted here are reviewed by each hub's own volunteers,
# not the repo owner. When someone volunteers, add their GitHub username to the
# hub's line below and to its "maintainers" list in hubs.json. Lines stay
# commented out until a hub has at least one reviewer.
# /profiles/community/    @username
# /profiles/us/           @username
# /profiles/africa/       @username
# /profiles/middle-east/  @username
